{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42795","headline":"郡斋寓兴 · 刘兼","name":"郡斋寓兴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"依约樊川似旭川，郡斋风物尽萧然。\n秋庭碧藓铺云锦，晚阁红蕖簇水仙。\n醉笔语狂挥粉壁，歌梁尘乱拂花钿。\n情怀放荡无羁束，地角天涯亦信缘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘兼","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42795.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42795","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}